  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Information for All Programme (IFAP) is an International Intergovernmental Programme that assists Member States to develop innovative knowledge society policies and strategies integrating Information for Development, Information Literacy, Information Preservation, Information Ethics, Information Accessibility and Multilingualism in Cyberspace. The Programme is composed of a Council, Bureau, working Groups and national IFAP Committees around the world. This activity will support the management of the statutory Council and Bureau meetings.</narrative>
